 "about": "SPEC-v3.5 \u00a71: the parts library. `thing`: every thing part. A base has `spots` (where other parts may go); a top or a wrap has `on` (the spots it may sit on). `layer` is behind, body or front. `glow`: it gets a soft halo. `sound`: what it sounds like (\u00a73.4). `kinds`: for every kind in kinds.json, the base part it is built on and the signature part it gives to an invention. `rules`: the composition limits. The engine composes inventions from the names here; the view draws them. Drawing fields (file, rect, where each spot is in pixels, regions) are added per part by the art.",
